  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  _legalCanvas: {fileID: 1483}
  _titleLabel: {fileID: 2093}
  _bodyText: {fileID: 2006}
  _effectiveDateLabel: {fileID: 2010}
  _scrollRect: {fileID: 2212}
  _closeButton: {fileID: 2476}
  _documents:
  - title: Terms of Service
    effectiveDate: September 9, 2026
    body: "These Terms of Service (the \"Terms\") are a binding agreement between
      you and K-LAB IT SOLUTIONS (\"we\", \"us\"), the operator of KlassX Online
      (the \"Game\") and its website. By creating an account, installing the Game,
      or using the website, you agree to these Terms. If you do not agree, do not
      use the Game.\r\n\r\n\r\n<b><color=#FFC107>1. WHO WE ARE</color></b>\r\n\r\n\xE2\u20AC\xA2
      Operator: K-LAB IT SOLUTIONS\r\n\xE2\u20AC\xA2 Address: Santa Maria, Bulacan,
      Philippines\r\n\xE2\u20AC\xA2 Contact: support@k-lab-itsolutions.com\r\n\r\n\r\n<b><color=#FFC107>2.
      ELIGIBILITY & AGE</color></b>\r\n\r\n\xE2\u20AC\xA2 You must be at least 13
      years old to hold an account.\r\n\xE2\u20AC\xA2 If you live in the European
      Economic Area or the United Kingdom, you must be at least 16, or have the consent
      of a parent or guardian.\r\n\xE2\u20AC\xA2 If you are under the age of majority
      where you live, you may only use the Game with the involvement and consent
      of a parent or guardian, who accepts these Terms on your behalf.\r\n\r\nWe
      may suspend or close any account we believe belongs to someone below the minimum
      age, and will delete the associated personal data. A parent or guardian can
      ask us to do this at support@k-lab-itsolutions.com.\r\n\r\n\r\n<b><color=#FFC107>3.
      YOUR ACCOUNT</color></b>\r\n\r\n\xE2\u20AC\xA2 Keep your password and PIN code
      confidential \xE2\u20AC\u201D they protect your account and your items.\r\n\xE2\u20AC\xA2
      You are responsible for activity under your account, unless it results from
      our fault.\r\n\xE2\u20AC\xA2 One person may not use another person's account,
      and accounts may not be sold or traded.\r\n\xE2\u20AC\xA2 Tell us at support@k-lab-itsolutions.com
      as soon as you believe your account has been compromised.\r\n\r\n\r\n<b><color=#FFC107>4.
      LICENCE TO PLAY</color></b>\r\n\r\nWe grant you a personal, limited, non-exclusive,
      non-transferable and revocable licence to play the Game for your own non-commercial
      entertainment. You do not own the Game, your account, or any in-game item \xE2\u20AC\u201D
      they remain ours, and this licence ends when your account does.\r\n\r\n\r\n<b><color=#FFC107>5.
      FAIR PLAY & CONDUCT</color></b>\r\n\r\nPlay fairly and respect other players.
      Do not:\r\n\r\n\xE2\u20AC\xA2 Use cheats, hacks, bots, macros, or exploits\r\n\xE2\u20AC\xA2
      Abuse bugs or system errors instead of reporting them\r\n\xE2\u20AC\xA2 Harass,
      threaten, or use hateful, sexual, or otherwise offensive language\r\n\xE2\u20AC\xA2
      Impersonate staff or other players, or attempt to obtain another player's credentials\r\n\xE2\u20AC\xA2
      Advertise, spam, or sell accounts, items, or currency for real money\r\n\r\nWe
      may issue warnings, suspend, or permanently ban accounts that break these rules,
      without refund of any unused E-Points.\r\n\r\n\r\n<b><color=#FFC107>6. CHAT
      & PLAYER CONTENT</color></b>\r\n\r\nThe Game includes chat and other features
      where players can communicate. You are responsible for what you post, and you
      must not post anything unlawful, abusive, or objectionable.\r\n\r\nWe do not
      tolerate objectionable content or abusive players. To report a player or a
      message:\r\n\r\n\xE2\u20AC\xA2 <b>In-game:</b> tap or long-press the player's
      name or message and select <b>Report</b>, then choose a reason\r\n\xE2\u20AC\xA2
      <b>In-game:</b> select <b>Block</b> to immediately hide that player's messages
      from your view\r\n\xE2\u20AC\xA2 <b>Website:</b> open a ticket from <b>Account
      \xE2\u2020\u2019 Support</b>\r\n\xE2\u20AC\xA2 <b>Email:</b> support@k-lab-itsolutions.com\r\n\r\nWe
      aim to review reports within 24 hours and may remove content, and warn, mute,
      suspend, or ban the account responsible.\r\n\r\n\r\n<b><color=#FFC107>7. E-POINTS,
      ITEMS & PURCHASES</color></b>\r\n\r\n\xE2\u20AC\xA2 E-Points (EP) and Game
      Points (GP) are a licence to use in-game features. They are <b>not money</b>,
      have no real-world value, cannot be exchanged for cash, and cannot be transferred
      between accounts.\r\n\xE2\u20AC\xA2 Top-ups are purchased on our website through
      our payment provider. Prices, packages, and in-game items may change at any
      time.\r\n\xE2\u20AC\xA2 Where the Game is offered through an app store and
      a purchase is made inside the app, that purchase is handled by the app store,
      and its refund process applies.\r\n\xE2\u20AC\xA2 If your account is closed
      by you, or suspended or terminated for breaking these Terms, any unused EP
      or GP is forfeited.\r\n\r\nTop-ups are voluntary and, once E-Points are credited,
      are generally final and non-refundable. <b>This does not affect your statutory
      rights.</b> Where consumer law in your country gives you a right to cancel
      or a refund \xE2\u20AC\u201D including the EU/UK right of withdrawal \xE2\u20AC\u201D
      that right applies, and you can exercise it by contacting support@k-lab-itsolutions.com.\r\n\r\nFraudulent
      payments, chargebacks, or abuse of the payment system may result in suspension
      or a permanent ban.\r\n\r\n\r\n<b><color=#FFC107>8. GAME CONTENT, UPDATES &
      AVAILABILITY</color></b>\r\n\r\nAll Game content, systems, and features belong
      to us or our licensors. We may update, modify, rebalance, or reset Game data
      for maintenance, balance, or fixes. We work to keep the Game running smoothly,
      but downtime, bugs, and interruptions can happen, and features may be added
      or withdrawn.\r\n\r\n\r\n<b><color=#FFC107>9. CLOSING YOUR ACCOUNT</color></b>\r\n\r\nYou
      can delete your account at any time from <b>Account \xE2\u2020\u2019 Settings
      \xE2\u2020\u2019 Delete Account</b> on the website, or directly at <b>/delete-account</b>.
      Deletion is permanent: your characters, items, progress, and any unused EP
      and GP are lost and cannot be restored.\r\n\r\nWe may suspend or terminate
      your account if you break these Terms, if required by law, or if we stop operating
      the Game. Where we can, we will give notice first.\r\n\r\n\r\n<b><color=#FFC107>10.
      DISCLAIMERS & LIMITATION OF LIABILITY</color></b>\r\n\r\nTo the fullest extent
      permitted by law, the Game is provided <b>\"as is\"</b> and we are not responsible
      for:\r\n\r\n\xE2\u20AC\xA2 Data loss, lost items, or account issues not caused
      by us\r\n\xE2\u20AC\xA2 Downtime, bugs, or interruptions\r\n\xE2\u20AC\xA2
      Indirect or consequential losses arising from your use of the Game\r\n\r\nNothing
      in these Terms excludes liability that cannot be excluded by law, including
      liability for death or personal injury caused by negligence, or for fraud.
      Where liability cannot be excluded, it is limited to the amount you paid us
      in the twelve months before the claim arose.\r\n\r\n\r\n<b><color=#FFC107>11.
      CHANGES TO THESE TERMS</color></b>\r\n\r\nWe may update these Terms. For material
      changes we will give reasonable notice \xE2\u20AC\u201D in the Game, by email,
      or on the website \xE2\u20AC\u201D before they take effect. Continuing to play
      after that means you accept the updated Terms; if you do not, you may close
      your account.\r\n\r\n\r\n<b><color=#FFC107>12. GOVERNING LAW</color></b>\r\n\r\nThese
      Terms are governed by the laws of the Republic of the Philippines, and disputes
      will be heard by its courts. If you are a consumer, this does not deprive you
      of the protection of the mandatory law of the country where you live, or of
      the right to bring a claim there.\r\n\r\n\r\n<b><color=#FFC107>13. APPLE APP
      STORE \xE2\u20AC\u201D ADDITIONAL TERMS</color></b>\r\n\r\nThis section applies
      when you obtain the Game from the Apple App Store, and prevails over the rest
      of these Terms to the extent of any conflict.\r\n\r\n\xE2\u20AC\xA2 These Terms
      are between you and K-LAB IT SOLUTIONS only, <b>not with Apple</b>. We, not
      Apple, are solely responsible for the Game and its content.\r\n\xE2\u20AC\xA2
      The licence granted to you is a non-transferable licence to use the Game on
      any Apple-branded device you own or control, as permitted by the App Store
      Terms of Service.\r\n\xE2\u20AC\xA2 <b>Apple has no obligation to furnish any
      maintenance or support</b> for the Game.\r\n\xE2\u20AC\xA2 If the Game fails
      to conform to any applicable warranty, you may notify Apple, and Apple will
      refund the purchase price (if any). To the maximum extent permitted by law,
      Apple has no other warranty obligation with respect to the Game.\r\n\xE2\u20AC\xA2
      We, not Apple, are responsible for addressing any claim relating to the Game,
      including product liability claims, any claim that the Game fails to conform
      to a legal or regulatory requirement, and claims arising under consumer protection
      or similar legislation.\r\n\xE2\u20AC\xA2 We, not Apple, are responsible for
      the investigation, defence, settlement, and discharge of any third-party claim
      that the Game infringes that party's intellectual property rights.\r\n\xE2\u20AC\xA2
      You represent that you are not located in a country subject to a U.S. Government
      embargo or designated as a \"terrorist supporting\" country, and that you are
      not listed on any U.S. Government list of prohibited or restricted parties.\r\n\xE2\u20AC\xA2
      <b>Apple and its subsidiaries are third-party beneficiaries of these Terms</b>,
      and upon your acceptance Apple will have the right (and will be deemed to have
      accepted the right) to enforce these Terms against you as a third-party beneficiary.\r\n\r\n\r\n<b><color=#FFC107>14.
      CONTACT</color></b>\r\n\r\nQuestions about these Terms: support@k-lab-itsolutions.com,
      or K-LAB IT SOLUTIONS, Santa Maria, Bulacan, Philippines.\r\n"
    openButton: {fileID: 2118}
  - title: Privacy Policy
    effectiveDate: August 21, 2026
    body: "This policy explains what personal data K-LAB IT SOLUTIONS collects when
      you play KlassX Online or use our website, why we collect it, who we share
      it with, and the choices you have. K-LAB IT SOLUTIONS is the data controller.\n\n\n<b><color=#FF5722>1.
      WHO WE ARE & HOW TO REACH US</color></b>\n\n\xE2\u20AC\xA2 Controller: K-LAB
      IT SOLUTIONS\n\xE2\u20AC\xA2 Address: Santa Maria, Bulacan, Philippines\n\xE2\u20AC\xA2
      Privacy contact: support@k-lab-itsolutions.com\n\n\n<b><color=#FF5722>2. INFORMATION
      WE COLLECT</color></b>\n\n<b>Account information</b>\n\xE2\u20AC\xA2 Email
      address (used as your username)\n\xE2\u20AC\xA2 First and last name\n\xE2\u20AC\xA2
      Date of birth (to confirm you meet the minimum age)\n\xE2\u20AC\xA2 Password
      and PIN code, stored in hashed form \xE2\u20AC\u201D we never store them in
      plain text\n\xE2\u20AC\xA2 Referral code, where you enter one\n\n<b>Game and
      account activity</b>\n\xE2\u20AC\xA2 Characters, progress, items, and in-game
      currency balances\n\xE2\u20AC\xA2 Login records, and actions taken in the Game
      such as purchases and transfers\n\xE2\u20AC\xA2 Chat messages and reports,
      where needed for moderation and safety\n\n<b>Technical data</b>\n\xE2\u20AC\xA2
      IP address, device and operating system information, and server log data\n\xE2\u20AC\xA2
      Local storage and cookies used to keep you signed in and to keep the service
      secure\n\n<b>Payment data</b>\n\xE2\u20AC\xA2 Top-up records: amount, package,
      status, and payment reference. We keep these as proof of purchase and for accounting.\n\xE2\u20AC\xA2
      <b>We do not collect or store your card, bank, or e-wallet credentials.</b>
      Payments are processed by our payment provider (see section 4), and those details
      are handled by them.\n\n<b>Support</b>\n\xE2\u20AC\xA2 The content of support
      tickets and emails you send us, and our replies\n\n\n<b><color=#FF5722>3. WHY
      WE USE IT</color></b>\n\n\xE2\u20AC\xA2 To create and operate your account,
      and to run the Game \xE2\u20AC\u201D to perform our contract with you\n\xE2\u20AC\xA2
      To process top-ups and keep purchase records \xE2\u20AC\u201D contract, and
      our legal accounting duties\n\xE2\u20AC\xA2 To keep the Game safe and fair:
      preventing cheating, fraud, and abuse, and enforcing the Terms of Service \xE2\u20AC\u201D
      our legitimate interest in a secure service\n\xE2\u20AC\xA2 To answer support
      requests \xE2\u20AC\u201D contract and legitimate interest\n\xE2\u20AC\xA2
      To send service messages such as verification codes and account notices \xE2\u20AC\u201D
      contract\n\xE2\u20AC\xA2 To comply with legal obligations, or respond to lawful
      requests\n\n\n<b><color=#FF5722>4. WHO WE SHARE IT WITH</color></b>\n\n<b>We
      do not sell your personal data.</b> We share it only with providers who process
      it on our behalf, and only as far as they need it:\n\n\xE2\u20AC\xA2 <b>Payment
      providers</b> \xE2\u20AC\u201D payment processing for top-ups. They receive
      the information needed to take your payment and confirm it to us.\n\xE2\u20AC\xA2
      <b>Google reCAPTCHA</b> \xE2\u20AC\u201D protects registration and sign-in
      from automated abuse. Google receives device and usage signals; see Google's
      privacy policy.\n\xE2\u20AC\xA2 <b>Hosting and infrastructure providers</b>
      \xE2\u20AC\u201D who store and serve the Game, the website, and our databases.\n\xE2\u20AC\xA2
      <b>Email delivery</b> \xE2\u20AC\u201D to send verification codes and account
      notices.\n\nWe may also disclose data where required by law, to enforce our
      Terms, or to protect the rights and safety of players, and to a buyer or successor
      if our business is transferred.\n\n\n<b><color=#FF5722>5. INTERNATIONAL TRANSFERS</color></b>\n\nWe
      operate from the Republic of the Philippines and serve players in several countries,
      so your data may be stored or processed outside the country where you live,
      including by the providers above. Where the law requires it, we use appropriate
      safeguards \xE2\u20AC\u201D such as standard contractual clauses \xE2\u20AC\u201D
      for those transfers.\n\n\n<b><color=#FF5722>6. HOW LONG WE KEEP IT</color></b>\n\n\xE2\u20AC\xA2
      Account and game data: while your account exists\n\xE2\u20AC\xA2 After you
      delete your account: erased or anonymised without undue delay, except where
      we must keep something longer\n\xE2\u20AC\xA2 Payment and top-up records: kept
      for the period our tax and accounting obligations require\n\xE2\u20AC\xA2 Security,
      fraud, and ban records: kept as long as needed to stop the same abuse recurring\n\n\n<b><color=#FF5722>7.
      DELETING YOUR ACCOUNT</color></b>\n\nYou can delete your account and its personal
      data at any time, without contacting support:\n\n\xE2\u20AC\xA2 In the Game,
      tap <b>Delete Account</b>, or\n\xE2\u20AC\xA2 On the website, go to <b>/delete-account</b>
      (also reachable from <b>Account \xE2\u2020\u2019 Settings \xE2\u2020\u2019
      Delete Account</b>)\n\nYou will be asked for your email, password, and PIN
      code to confirm it is really you. Deletion is permanent \xE2\u20AC\u201D characters,
      items, progress, and any unused EP and GP are lost and cannot be restored.\n\nWe
      retain only what section 6 describes: records we are legally required to keep,
      and the minimum needed to prevent fraud and ban evasion. If you cannot access
      your account, email support@k-lab-itsolutions.com and we will verify your identity
      and delete it for you.\n\n\n<b><color=#FF5722>8. YOUR RIGHTS</color></b>\n\nSubject
      to local law, you can ask us to:\n\n\xE2\u20AC\xA2 Give you a copy of the personal
      data we hold about you\n\xE2\u20AC\xA2 Correct data that is wrong or incomplete\n\xE2\u20AC\xA2
      Delete your data (see section 7)\n\xE2\u20AC\xA2 Restrict or object to how
      we use it, including on grounds of legitimate interest\n\xE2\u20AC\xA2 Receive
      your data in a portable format, or have it sent to another provider\n\xE2\u20AC\xA2
      Withdraw consent, where we rely on consent\n\nEmail support@k-lab-itsolutions.com
      to exercise any of these. We reply within 30 days. You also have the right
      to complain to your local data protection authority \xE2\u20AC\u201D in the
      Philippines, the National Privacy Commission.\n\n\n<b><color=#FF5722>9. CHILDREN</color></b>\n\nThe
      Game is not intended for children under 13 (under 16 in the EEA and UK, where
      local law requires it), and we do not knowingly collect their data. If we learn
      that an account belongs to a child below that age, we close it and delete the
      data. A parent or guardian who believes their child has given us personal data
      can write to support@k-lab-itsolutions.com and we will remove it.\n\n\n<b><color=#FF5722>10.
      SECURITY</color></b>\n\nWe protect your data with measures including encrypted
      connections, hashed passwords and PIN codes, access controls, and monitoring.
      No system is perfectly secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security. If
      a breach affects your personal data and poses a risk to you, we will notify
      you and the relevant authority as the law requires.\n\n\n<b><color=#FF5722>11.
      COOKIES & LOCAL STORAGE</color></b>\n\nOur website uses cookies and browser
      local storage to keep you signed in, remember your preferences, and protect
      against abuse. These are necessary for the site to work; blocking them may
      stop you from signing in.\n\n\n<b><color=#FF5722>12. CHANGES TO THIS POLICY</color></b>\n\nWe
      may update this policy. For material changes we will give notice on the website
      or by email before they take effect, and we will update the date at the top
      of this page.\n\n\n<b><color=#FF5722>13. CONTACT</color></b>\n\nPrivacy questions
      or requests: support@k-lab-itsolutions.com, or K-LAB IT SOLUTIONS, Santa Maria,
      Bulacan, Philippines.\n"
    openButton: {fileID: 2148}
  _effectiveDateFormat: 'Last updated: {0}'
  _closeOnBackButton: 1
  _startHidden: 1
